CB007219-ET-AA17_Verify successful intra-gNB DL CA setup in alternative bands with higher DL aggregated channel bandwidth
    [Documentation]
    ...    The purpose of this test case is to verify successful intra-gNB DL CA setup in alternative bands
    ...    with higher DL aggregated channel bandwidth
    ...    [Configuration]:
    ...    CB008140: NRDU:actInterGnbCa=DLOnly,NRCELL:actK1Opt=intraAndInter-gNB,NRBTS/NRDU/DlToUlContributionRatio is set to "101"
