    ...    5GC001416: NRBTS/actMultiFrequencyBandIndicatorNRSupport=true for both gNB-1 and gNB-2. NRBTS.actExtN77Support and
    ...    NRBTS.actExt2N77Support are set to "false".
    ...    Cell2_1 operates in the frequency range of 3450MHz<= F4 <=3550MHz
